no-self-tests: ENABLE_SELF_TESTS = NO

Classification: profile setting.

tpm-rs performs no algorithm self tests, so the reference does not either;
otherwise TPM2_SelfTest, TPM2_IncrementalSelfTest, TPM2_GetTestResult and
the first use of each algorithm would behave differently (e.g.
TPM_RC_TESTING).

diff --git a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmBuildSwitches.h b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmBuildSwitches.h
--- a/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmBuildSwitches.h
+++ b/TPMCmd/TpmConfiguration/TpmConfiguration/TpmBuildSwitches.h
@@ -175,7 +175,7 @@
 #define USE_DA_USED                 YES
 
 // This switch is used to enable the self-test capability in AlgorithmTests.c
-#define ENABLE_SELF_TESTS           YES
+#define ENABLE_SELF_TESTS           NO
 
